  "bodyTextSample": "01 MONUMENT 02 THE WAY 03 INDOOR HUB 04 CORE VALUES 05 PATHWAY 06 NETWORK 07 SIGNAL CHAPTER 01 / MONUMENT 26°57'N 49°34'E — JUBAIL, KSA FOOTBALL ACADEMY LEISURE CLUB SOUND OFF CHAPTERS CHAPTERS 01 / 07 SIGN FOR VISION7 CHAPTER 01 — JUBAIL, SAUDI ARABIA Holistic Development Through Football. UEFA & AFC certified coaching. FIFA-quality facilities. A fully developed player pathway for girls and boys of all ages — built around one number. 07 CORE VALUES 05 INDOOR ZONES 03 PATHWAY STEPS 20+ YEARS DEVELOPING PROS SCROLL TO ENTER ↓ CHAPTER 02 — THE VISION7 WAY One monument, four disciplines. Watch the 7 burn into light. Every particle is a data point — coaching, education, science and care, four orbits turning around each player. WAY_01 European Coaching UEFA & AFC certified curriculum, proven in developing International and Champions League players. WAY_02 Holistic Development Education, welfare, lifestyle and safeguarding support. Dual-career pathways as standard. WAY_03 Performance Science Sports psychology, nutrition, athlete recovery and in-house medical & physiotherapy. WAY_04 Individual Plans Physical & technical profiling with long-term goal-setting tailored to each player. CHAPTER 03 — INDOOR PERFORMANCE HUB A first of its kind in Saudi Arabia. This floor is live — click any zone on the pitch (or a card) to step inside and explore its features. CHAPTER 04 — OUR 7 CORE VALUES Seven values, one orbit. Scroll to rotate the ring. Every value orbits the same centre: the player. DEVELOPMENT DIVERSITY EQUAL OPPORTUNITIES TEAMWORK TOGETHERNESS HARDWORKING EMOTIONAL INTELLIGENCE CHAPTER 05 — YOUR VISION, YOUR JOURNEY The pathway draws itself. STEP_01 Development Centre Open to all abilities, girls & boys. Three coached sessions weekly, a competitive games programme and your first Vision7 kit. STEP_02 Academy Programme Invitation only — for players with professional potential, guided by a team with 20+ years developing top-flight footballers. STEP_03 Professional Alumni pathways to the Premier League, Women's Super League, Champions League and Saudi Professional Leagues. CHAPTER 06 — NETWORK & STORIES Stories worth sharing. NEWS / ANNOUNCEMENT Doors Open in Jubail A new era of football development begins in the Eastern Province. NEWS / TEAM European Staff Announced UEFA and AFC certified coaches bring decades of professional experience. NEWS / COMMUNITY 1 Child, 1 Vision Fully funded scholarships — one boy and one girl, every season. FORZA REZZIL SPIIDEO STRK ELITE ESPORTS ESA CHAPTER 07 — SIGNAL Tell us about your Vision. Have a question or want to learn more? Get in touch with our team. TRANSMIT → INFO@VISION7.SA 920019777 info@vision7.sa Lulu District, Al Jubail 35716, KSA 06:00 By day, the club. WELLNESS • GYM • PADEL • POOL → Envision. Empower. Evolve. AN ALMUZAIN GROUP INITIATIVE © 2026 VISION 7",
